title: "Less Precise, More Reliable: Quantization for Efficient and Robust Road-Scene Perception"
abstract: >-
  Material of a three-hour tutorial at the 2026 IEEE International Conference on Vehicular
  Electronics and Safety (ICVES), 9 November 2026, Cochabamba, Bolivia: slides, lecture notes
  and a hands-on notebook on quantization for efficient and robust road-scene perception.
